---
import '../../styles/lab/v4/visual-spike.css';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#090d12" />
    <meta name="description" content="Arkadiusz Kamrowski. Strategy, architecture and the conditions for execution." />
    <title>Strategy shows up in choices. · Arkadiusz Kamrowski</title>
    <link rel="icon" href="/assets/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml" />
  </head>
  <body class="v4-page">
    <a class="v4-skip" href="#narrative">Skip to content</a>
    <header class="v4-header">
      <a class="v4-brand" href="#hero" aria-label="Arkadiusz Kamrowski, introduction"><span>ak<span>·</span></span><span>Arkadiusz<br />Kamrowski</span></a>
      <nav aria-label="Main navigation"><a href="#complexity">Perspective</a><a href="#execution">About</a><a href="/en/contact">Let’s talk <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></nav>
    </header>
    <main id="narrative" tabindex="-1" data-v4>
      <div class="v4-environment" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="v4-fallback"><svg viewBox="0 0 1200 900" fill="none"><defs><linearGradient id="metal"><stop stop-color="#13191e"/><stop offset=".48" stop-color="#555e66"/><stop offset=".51" stop-color="#10161c"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#52616c"/></linearGradient></defs><g stroke="#76848c" stroke-width="1.2" fill="url(#metal)"><path d="M570 170 870 95 870 620 570 700ZM625 215 625 620 817 567 817 167Z" fill-rule="evenodd"/><path d="M760 185 1000 260 1000 680 760 606ZM803 247 803 562 958 609 958 294Z" fill-rule="evenodd"/></g></svg></div>
        <div class="v4-canvas" data-v4-canvas></div>
      </div>
      <section class="v4-act v4-hero" id="hero" data-act="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
        <div class="v4-copy">
          <p class="v4-eyebrow">Arkadiusz Kamrowski · Technology & transformation</p>
          <h1 id="hero-title">Strategy<br />shows up<br />in <em>choices.</em></h1>
          <p class="v4-lead">Connecting executive intent<br />with the conditions for execution.</p>
          <a class="v4-link" href="/en/contact">Discuss a difficult decision <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="v4-act v4-complexity" id="complexity" data-act="complexity" aria-labelledby="complexity-title">
        <div class="v4-copy">
          <p class="v4-eyebrow">01 / Read the system</p>
          <h2 id="complexity-title">The problem<br />is rarely<br /><em>one thing.</em></h2>
          <p class="v4-lead">A priority here. A constraint elsewhere.<br />An owner caught in between.</p>
          <p>Decisions travel through funding, technology and accountability. Their consequences cross the boundaries on the organization chart.</p>
          <a class="v4-text-link" href="/en/perspective">A closer perspective <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        </div>
        <p class="v4-margin-note">Understand the relationships<br />before changing the structure.</p>
      </section>
      <section class="v4-act v4-decision" id="decision" data-act="decision" aria-labelledby="decision-title">
        <div class="v4-copy">
          <p class="v4-eyebrow">02 / Make the choice</p>
          <h2 id="decision-title">Clarity takes<br /><em>a decision.</em></h2>
          <p class="v4-lead">What do we pursue?<br />What do we stop?<br />Who has the mandate?</p>
          <p>Make the trade-offs explicit. Give the decision an owner. Align investment, architecture and the way work gets done.</p>
          <div class="v4-decision-rail" aria-label="Three decision questions"><span>YES <small>A direction</small></span><span>NO <small>A boundary</small></span><span>WHO <small>An accountable owner</small></span></div>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="v4-act v4-coherence" id="coherence" data-act="coherence" aria-labelledby="coherence-title">
        <div class="v4-copy">
          <p class="v4-eyebrow">03 / Build coherence</p>
          <h2 id="coherence-title">One direction.<br /><em>Connected action.</em></h2>
          <p class="v4-lead">A shared opening is only useful<br />if the organization can move through it.</p>
          <p>Decision rights, technology and investment need to support the same choice. Coherence is a condition for delivery.</p>
          <a class="v4-text-link" href="/en/advisory">From decision to delivery <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="v4-act v4-execution" id="execution" data-act="execution" aria-labelledby="execution-title">
        <div class="v4-person">
          <p class="v4-eyebrow">04 / Stay with the consequences</p>
          <h2 id="execution-title">A decision is<br />the <em>beginning.</em></h2>
          <p class="v4-lead">I work on decisions whose consequences extend beyond one department. I care about what happens to them after the meeting ends.</p>
          <p>My perspective connects technology delivery, enterprise architecture, strategy and portfolio decisions. Evidence can change the plan. Accountability makes it real.</p>
          <a class="v4-text-link" href="/en/about">Meet Arkadiusz <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
          <div class="v4-credentials"><p><strong>10+ years</strong><span>Technology, architecture & transformation</span></p><p><strong>MBA</strong><span>Kozminski University · 2024–2025</span></p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="v4-contact" id="conversation">
          <p class="v4-eyebrow">05 / Start a conversation</p>
          <h2>What needs<br /><em>to be decided?</em></h2>
          <a class="v4-link" href="/en/contact">Let’s work through it <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
          <p>A specific situation. The people involved.<br />The choice that cannot stay open.</p>
        </div>
      </section>
      <aside class="v4-debug" data-debug hidden aria-label="Development controls"><p>V4.2 / Development only</p><label>Scene position <input data-seek type="range" min="0" max="4.5" step="0.01" value="0" /></label><button data-resume>Resume document scrolling</button><button data-detail>Material close-up</button><p data-status role="status">Architectural illustration. Executive content is available without WebGL.</p></aside>
    </main>
    <footer class="v4-footer"><span>Arkadiusz Kamrowski</span><span>Independent judgment. Deliberate structure.</span><a href="/en/privacy">Privacy</a><a href="#hero">Back to the beginning ↑</a></footer>
    <script>import '../../scripts/lab/v4/visual-spike';</script>
  </body>
</html>
